  "system": {
    "description": "<p><strong>Range:</strong> Touch</p><p>The wound closes, but it does not close the way it opened, and the flesh that closed it was needed elsewhere.</p><p>Choose an adjacent creature and make a <strong>4:1 Soul (Metaphysics)</strong> check. The target recovers <strong>1 Stamina</strong> per success.</p><p>You may optionally spend <strong>1 Resolve</strong> to remove <strong>1 Wound</strong> from the target. If you do, the target's <strong>Body</strong> is reduced by <strong>-1</strong>.</p><p>When the target completes a <strong>Long Rest</strong>, it may restore any amount of <strong>Body</strong> lost this way at the cost of <strong>+1 Wounds</strong> per <strong>Body</strong> restored. <strong>1 Wound</strong> is still restored during the <strong>Long Rest</strong>, as is normal.</p><p><strong>Effect:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.titan-vttrpg-compendium.effects.ActiveEffect.gXXKQN6fB4AUEYjS]{Deathsinger's Mercy}</p>",
